WEBVTT

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.430
KENGAN LIFE-OR-DEATH

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.590
SAYAKA KATAHARA
DAUGHTER OF METSUDO KATAHARA

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.930
Now, let's introduce the fighters
for the tenth match.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:32.530
GAME 10

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.400
This music...

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.120
Isn't it "The Eccentric Parade"?

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.740
Ah, the one they put on
at Tochigi Destinyland?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.750
This is a nostalgic tune, isn't it?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:48.130
It brings back memories of the time
we went to Destinyland together.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.670
SEN HATSUMI
FIGHTER OF NOGI GROUP

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:51.460
It doesn't. That's in ancient times.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:53.050
SHION SORYUIN
KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.010
Ancient times? Well, I guess you're right.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:59.560
You were just a young girl,
still in high school.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.770
<i>You were in your twenties, too.</i>

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.310
<i>Do you want me to kill you?</i>

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:08.650
<i>We got into a fight and broke up</i>
<i>right after that, didn't we?</i>

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.070
<i>Yeah, because you cheated on me.</i>

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:16.570
Then we were on and off for quite a while.

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.950
-Hey, Shion.
-No.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.330
I will never go out with you again...

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:35.470
-What the hell is that?
-What the hell is that?

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:40.300
Hey, Shion. Did Mockey always
have that kind of physique?

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:42.430
Obviously not.

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.890
That's not a fighter, is it?

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:50.440
Oh, by the way, I was about to ask
if I could borrow a cigarette.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.820
What were you saying "no" to?

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.780
I didn't say such a thing, you idiot.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:00.240
<i>The mightiest warrior</i>
<i>from the Land of Dreams!</i>

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.580
<i>He is the ultimate weapon</i>
<i>of the power corporation</i>

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.370
<i>known as Tochigi Destinyland.</i>

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.170
<i>He makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.250
<i>Today, we are going to witness</i>
<i>the Destiny magic.</i>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.340
<i>Standing at 221 cm and weighing 111 kg,</i>

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.090
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.140
Representing Tochigi Destinyland,

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:26.520
<i>also known as</i>
<i>the Man from the Land of Dreams,</i>

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:30.310
<i>Masami Nezu!</i>

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.530
HAJIME HANAFUSA
KOKOMI YOSHIZAWA

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.200
He's got an interesting body.
I would love to dissect him.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.330
Doctor, he is wearing
a stuffed animal suit on his head.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.870
<i>I'll end it.</i>

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:53.670
<i>I have to end it.</i>

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:57.210
<i>Farewell, the Land of Dreams.</i>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.550
<i>Goodbye, Mockey.</i>

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:10.520
It's unbelievable!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.230
Mockey's head just cracked open

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:15.110
<i>and a delinquent came out of it!</i>

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.030
MASAMI NEZU, REP. FIGHTER
TOCHIGI DESTINYLAND

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.240
I'm so sorry, Mockey!

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.180
What the hell?

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.990
OHMA TOKITA - KAZUO YAMASHITA -
KAEDE AKIYAMA

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:26.240
I'm going to end this nightmare for you!

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:31.960
<i>I see. He split his mask in two</i>
<i>with an awfully fast kick.</i>

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.710
HIDEKI NOGI
CHAIRMAN OF NOGI GROUP

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.750
He's not just for show, huh?

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:41.090
KUNIHIRO YUMENO
TOCHIGI DESTINYLAND

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.260
<i>Masami Nezu was</i>
<i>the third leader of Bakuonchitai,</i>

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:47.260
<i>the biggest motorcycle gang</i>
<i>in Tochigi prefecture.</i>

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.190
<i>Capitalizing on his skills</i>
<i>and abnormal body build,</i>

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:55.060
<i>he entered underground combat sports.</i>

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:00.110
<i>Nezu was easily recruited</i>
<i>for the kengan matches.</i>

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.650
<i>That's because...</i>

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.740
<i>For real?</i>
<i>Can I really be Mockey?</i>

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:11.500
<i>...he was a Tochigi Destinyland fanatic.</i>

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:16.960
<i>Nezu is a real idiot,</i>
<i>but his strength is also real.</i>

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.800
<i>A strong idiot is such an easy tool.</i>

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.800
That was a good kick.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.300
It was sharp, heavy and quick.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:29.970
What? Excuse me.
I haven't introduced you yet.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.430
Then do it now.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.520
I don't want to keep Rino waiting.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.060
REI MIKAZUCHI
GOLD PLEASURE GROUP

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.560
Rei.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.230
Be careful not to hurt yourself.

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:40.360
RINO KURAYOSHI

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.030
Um...

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:46.240
Now, let me introduce this fighter.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:50.490
<i>Standing at 179 cm and weighing 77 kg,</i>

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:53.960
his kengan match record is
one win and no losses.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.790
His totals assets acquired is
one billion 211 million 400 thousand yen.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.800
Representing Gold Pleasure Group,

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:07.510
<i>also known as the Lightning God,</i>
<i>Rei Mikazuchi!</i>

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.020
Both of you, take your starting positions.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.020
<i>The two fighters are facing off!</i>

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.190
<i>Which one of them will win?</i>

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.900
<i>Will it be the warrior of dreams</i>
<i>or the warrior of love?</i>

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:27.030
<i>Rino... I'll dedicate this victory to you.</i>

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:31.990
<i>Mockey, I'm going to be with you</i>
<i>until the end of your life.</i>

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:07.920
THE RAKSHASA

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.430
<i>The Raishin Style.</i>

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:16.140
<i>A mysterious art of assassination</i>
<i>said to have a 1,200-year history.</i>

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:21.940
<i>This dreadful martial art</i>
<i>holds contempt for authority,</i>

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:27.480
<i>but has been secretly, yet surely,</i>
<i>passed down to the modern era.</i>

00:07:28.490 --> 00:07:33.530
<i>After nine days without eating,</i>
<i>drinking, or sleeping,</i>

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:37.290
<i>Rei had been standing here for two days.</i>

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:42.540
<i>His decreased respiratory functions</i>
<i>from the fatigue resulted in hypoxia,</i>

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:45.130
<i>which caused visual</i>
<i>and auditory hallucinations.</i>

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.340
<i>However,</i>

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:50.260
<i>while his body was in extremis,</i>

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:55.100
<i>his mind was sharper than ever.</i>

00:07:56.550 --> 00:07:59.770
<i>He cast away his techniques, body,</i>

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.270
<i>and even his thoughts.</i>

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:08.320
<i>The boundary between himself and others</i>
<i>no longer has meaning.</i>

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:14.070
<i>Slowly and gradually,</i>
<i>it melts into the darkness.</i>

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:18.620
<i>And so, Mikazuchi vanishes</i>
<i>into the darkness.</i>

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.340
<i>Good.</i>

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:32.100
You did it, Rei.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.630
BYO MIKAZUCHI
MASTER OF RAISHIN STYLE

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:37.300
<i>I have witnessed your lightning.</i>

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:42.060
<i>As of this moment,</i>
<i>I hereby forsake the art.</i>

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:46.730
<i>The Raishin Style and the Mikazuchi name</i>
<i>are yours now.</i>

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:48.400
<i>Do whatever you want with them.</i>

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:51.320
<i>Don't forget, Rei.</i>

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:54.240
<i>Being like the lightning is not enough.</i>

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.200
<i>You must "be" the lightning.</i>

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.160
<i>I can see it.</i>

00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:05.420
<i>You're pretty strong, aren't you?</i>

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:08.500
<i>But it's too bad for you.</i>

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.420
<i>I'm feeling invincible now.</i>

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.050
Fight!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.270
Lightning Flash.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.520
Lightning can never be evaded.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.940
<i>Ah! The match stops here!</i>

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.190
<i>We have a winner!</i>

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.940
<i>The winner is Rei Mikazuchi.</i>

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.150
Foolish man.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.780
Dreams always come to an end.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.490
But love lasts forever.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:43.660
That man...

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.430
His engine is on a whole other level.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:47.200
SAW PAING YOROIZUKA
FIGHTER VILLAGE OF DAWN

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:50.460
<i>I'm going to fight that guy</i>
<i>in the second round?</i>

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.130
Yeah!

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.050
I'm getting fired up!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.970
This was supposed to be my farewell.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.560
Mr. Yumeno told me
before the tournament...

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.980
that we were-- That Destinyland was...

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.650
KATSUMASA HAYAMI
TOYO ELECTRIC POWER CO

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.280
<i>...going to affiliate with Toyo.</i>

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.990
<i>Why? Destinyland is a wonderland.</i>

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:26.040
<i>We shouldn't team up</i>
<i>with such a vicious company.</i>

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:30.580
<i>Well, whether we like it or not,</i>
<i>our financial situation isn't at its best.</i>

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.920
<i>This is the reality.</i>

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.170
<i>I loved it for real.</i>

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:40.470
<i>I loved how Destinyland was</i>
<i>free of any interference.</i>

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:49.060
<i>But the Land of Dreams I believed in</i>
<i>was invaded by reality.</i>

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.820
<i>That's why I decided to end the dream.</i>

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.860
I wanted my dear Mockey
to be remembered as an ideal.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:02.240
You can laugh at me.

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:06.490
No way I could've won
in such a negative frame of mind.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.710
Are you giving up?

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:13.960
That's not like you, Nezu.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.630
Tochigi's thugs are the best in the world!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.300
MIKI TAKEMARU,
SECOND LEADER OF MERMAID

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.640
You're the shining star
of all Tochigi's thugs.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:24.800
And I know you're going to win next time.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:28.680
I'll follow you for the rest of my life!

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:30.940
Miki...

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:34.230
will you start over with me?

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.610
Yes, sir!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.070
Thank you, Rei.

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.280
Mm-hmm.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:44.410
I'm so proud of you because you won
without hurting your opponent.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.530
Mm-hmm.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.580
You kept your promise to me.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:50.040
Mm-hmm.

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.960
You don't have to kill anyone anymore.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:11:55.340
Mm-hmm.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:02.470
My lord, you are up next.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.890
Please change into your battle clothes.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.100
Yes.
The time has come.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.680
REN NIKAIDO
BYAKUYA SHIMBUN COMPANY

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:10.560
Let's go.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.770
A man of mysteries has come
from across the ocean.

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:18.020
<i>A good-looking but unidentified fighter.</i>

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:22.950
<i>This mysterious fighter from Taiwan</i>
<i>will dance in the arena.</i>

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:27.120
<i>Standing at 174 cm and weighing 73 kg,</i>

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.790
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today!</i>

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.710
Representing the Byakuya Shimbun Company,

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:37.710
<i>also known as the Watchman, Ren Nikaido!</i>

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:49.350
Whoa! What obscenity am I looking at?

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.600
TOMOKO MATSUDA

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:51.890
What's your problem?

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.520
<i>The next fighter is</i>
<i>as mysterious as his opponent.</i>

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:59.900
<i>He appeared out of blue</i>
<i>and entered the tournament.</i>

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:05.490
<i>Here comes the beautiful beast!</i>

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:09.240
<i>Standing at 180 cm and weighing 75 kg,</i>

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.370
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>one win and no losses.</i>

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:17.130
Total assets he has acquired is
25 billion 72 million yen.

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:19.790
Representing Kouou Education Group,

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:24.340
<i>also known as the Beautiful Beast,</i>
<i>Setsuna Kiryu!</i>

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:30.310
SETSUNA KIRYU, REP. FIGHTER
KOUOU EDUCATION GROUP

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:35.310
Aw. The drawing made
such an amazing couple.

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.350
How beautiful! How gorgeous!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:41.820
The battle between the handsome men
of the century begins now.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.940
The ladies are going wild!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.700
JERRY TYSON
(ELIMINATED)

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:50.450
Every last one of them has
a girlish look on his face.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.450
That crest...

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.330
Take your stance!

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:04.050
Come on. I'll show you
there's no comparison between us.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.840
Take the fist of Heavenly Wolf.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.970
Is something wrong, Kazuo Yamashita?

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:15.980
Oh, um... nothing.

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:20.440
<i>I can't quite put it into words,</i>

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.070
<i>but isn't he a bit strange?</i>

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:28.910
<i>Setsuna Kiryu.</i>
<i>I've done my research on you.</i>

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:34.160
<i>You use the Koei Style,</i>
<i>one of the classical jujitsu.</i>

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:37.210
<i>It's nothing more than</i>
<i>an island nation's </i>kenpo<i>.</i>

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:40.500
<i>You will be the hungry wolf's prey.</i>

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.130
Fight!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:46.880
<i>Tai hao le!</i>

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.880
<i>I am faster than you.</i>

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.390
<i>Drown in despair, pretty boy!</i>

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.600
Son of a bitch!

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.770
What the hell did you do?!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.940
How did you dare to harm me

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.820
although I am an offering to him?

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.900
Since you scarred me,

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.370
you must pay for this...

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.870
with your life.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.670
<i>That was a blunder.</i>

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:28.760
<i>I outstrip him in speed.</i>
<i>How did he get behind me?</i>

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:39.770
<i>Why? Why can't I keep up with him?</i>

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:43.440
<i>My left arm... still moves.</i>

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:46.360
<i>My shoulder... can't.</i>

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:50.780
<i>Damn it! I should be way better than this.</i>

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:54.200
Are you even trying to fight?

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.540
Honestly, I don't care about you at all.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:02.170
I'll spare you if you surrender.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.880
You're overflowing with joy, you freak.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.800
Come to think of it,

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:11.840
I know someone who's exactly like you.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.840
Oh. Someone like me?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:19.060
I bet that person is an ugly one, too.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.850
He's dead.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.480
It was such a cruel, miserable death.

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.230
Is that so? I'm jealous.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.280
He was saved.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.610
You lunatics understand each other?

00:16:35.820 --> 00:16:38.830
<i>I don't need to raise my left arm</i>
<i>for this.</i>

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.410
<i>Secret technique, Qilong!</i>

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:46.210
That's a unique form, but so what?

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.590
<i>The Koei Style...</i>

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:51.090
<i>Blink.</i>

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.220
<i>Focus.</i>

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:57.090
<i>Sense the moment</i>
<i>he enters within my range.</i>

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.200
What the...

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:17.950
What the hell?

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:20.240
I was right about the crest.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:26.710
<i>That's the lost Japanese-style</i>
<i>Chinese martial art: Tenroken.</i>

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:32.590
<i>Tenroken's secret technique Qilong</i>
<i>has three steps.</i>

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:38.840
<i>Void: Compress air in the palms</i>
<i>and release it all at once.</i>

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:42.930
<i>Those who get exposed to the blast</i>
<i>within 15 meters of it</i>

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.480
<i>would become unable to move for a moment.</i>

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:49.360
<i>Illusion: Whisper a secret spell</i>
<i>into their ear</i>

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.730
<i>where their entire attention</i>
<i>is concentrated.</i>

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.440
<i>It is a so-called</i>
<i>"instantaneous hypnosis."</i>

00:17:54.030 --> 00:18:00.530
<i>And then, Light: Deliver a fajin strike</i>
<i>to the hypnotized defenseless opponent.</i>

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.830
<i>Even in pre-arranged sparring,</i>

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:05.450
<i>it's said to be impossible</i>
<i>to recreate this technique.</i>

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:07.330
<i>But he did it in the actual match.</i>

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:12.840
<i>Ren Nikaido is far beyond me</i>
<i>as a martial artist.</i>

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.970
<i>Oh! Kiryu is moving.</i>

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.300
<i>But it looks like...</i>

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.510
<i>He looks groggy.</i>

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:27.060
Oh, you pulled yourself to your feet
while still under hypnosis.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:30.980
I'll show respect for your spirit
and play with you a little longer.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.780
Where should I start destroying you?

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.900
I'm going to get you back
for hurting my left--

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:47.750
<i>Oh! Nikaido is coughing up blood!</i>

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.580
<i>What on earth is happening here?</i>

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.920
<i>Don't tell me</i>

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.800
<i>that he hit me at that moment.</i>

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.510
<i>That's impossible!</i>

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:01.720
<i>I'm sure my hypnosis worked on him.</i>

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:05.010
<i>Did he break out of the hypnosis</i>
<i>in that split second?</i>

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:07.730
<i>No, that's impossible.</i>

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:16.690
What's going on?

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:20.070
Kiryu's changed.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.530
I owe you my gratitude.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:27.290
I had a dream.

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:30.040
A very nostalgic one.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.380
It's the sin that I've borne.

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.920
Did you know?

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.630
There are two kinds of people:

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:40.930
those who deserve to be happy
and those who don't.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:47.430
<i>Ren Nikaido performed instant hypnosis</i>
<i>when he pulled off Qilong.</i>

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:51.060
I am one of the latter.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.310
<i>That awakened something unexpectedly.</i>

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:57.940
Ren Nikaido,

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:01.320
will you become my sin?

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.320
<i>Ashura awakens!</i>

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.410
<i>He's got a different air now.</i>

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:10.410
<i>Don't be deceived.</i>

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.620
<i>He should still be under my hypnosis.</i>

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.000
<i>I'll hit him with all I've got...</i>

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.460
<i>with all of my Jin.</i>

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:25.890
I've seen that one already.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:30.890
I don't like pain. Don't hurt me so much.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:34.900
<i>He... warded off my attack?</i>

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.900
Come on. Show me your next technique.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:40.900
You might be able to take me down.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.950
<i>Cao ni ma!</i>

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:56.920
Ah! Is that...

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.840
Ohma's move?

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:05.550
Groveling on the ground suits the weak.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:08.430
Hey. Are you not ashamed?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.640
You can't fight back at all.

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.060
Don't underestimate me, Setsuna Kiryu.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.070
-The match isn't over--
-Let me tell you one last thing.

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:25.700
The Koei Style has only
two named techniques.

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:28.070
One is called Blink.

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.540
It's the technique that just put me
behind you.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.160
And the other one is...

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.080
Well, I'll let you experience it now.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:40.340
Wait! I surrend--

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.180
The Koei Style, Rakshasa's Palm.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:50.930
It's a technique that impacts
your heart and twists it.

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:55.810
<i>Oh! He's down!</i>

00:21:56.270 --> 00:22:00.610
<i>Nikaido collapsed to the ground,</i>
<i>coughing up blood.</i>

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:01.860
We have a winner!

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:03.900
<i>It's over!</i>

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:09.820
<i>In a match between beauties, victory went</i>
<i>to the Beautiful Beast, Setsuna Kiryu!</i>

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:16.790
<i>I wonder why</i>
<i>I wanted to show my true colors today.</i>

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:18.120
<i>Perhaps...</i>

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:22.040
<i>I got excited</i>
<i>knowing you were watching me.</i>

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:29.470
<i>I can't wait, Ohma.</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:33.970
<i>Me neither, Setsuna Kiryu!</i>

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:06.980
PREVIEW

00:24:07.070 --> 00:24:08.610
<i>Master, murderer, </i>kenpo<i>.</i>

00:24:08.820 --> 00:24:10.440
<i>He's strong. Extremely strong.</i>

00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:12.490
<i>A man with remarkable ability,</i>
<i>Gensai Kuroki.</i>

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:14.490
<i>He's frail. Too frail.</i>

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:17.830
<i>The Super Human, Lihito.</i>
<i>Lihito is going to get tested.</i>

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:20.000
<i>Don't make light of him!</i>
<i>Next episode: "Devil Lance."</i>

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:21.580
Subtitle translation by Miki Miyaji
